WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.480
You can draw when you successfully summon it!

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.010
If you don't draw a monster 
card, this card is destroyed.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.540
Toby…

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.930
Toby…

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.920
Aki headed towards the final tower.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.690
There’s only one seal left!

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:55.870
But if we don’t seal it by sunset, we 
can't close the gates to the underworld.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:57.860
Aki…

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:03.340
Misty talked to me before.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:09.310
Yes.  You made me and my 
younger brother feel hopeless.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.960
You killed my brother!

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.640
Is that true?

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.640
I don’t remember.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.930
Maybe there's a misunderstanding.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:22.000
No.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:25.020
Her anger isn't an act.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:33.290
But in order to help Yusei, I have to 
finish things with Dark Signer Misty.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:51.680
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:56.780
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:01.700
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.450
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.820
No matter how bad today is

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:16.800
There's still the faintest light

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:22.200
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.270
Is light it myself

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:31.280
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:36.250
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:42.550
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:46.530
Today will never exist again

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:52.430
So I won't stop or vanish

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:21.720
Sad Story - Sorrowful Memories

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.720
We have to find Misty quickly.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:34.000
We don’t know when the geoglyph 
will appear, so be careful.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.820
Right.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.110
Aki and Mikage must already be inside.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:53.160
But it doesn't look like 
the duel has started yet.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.560
Let’s split up and look for them.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:04.790
It's depressing when there’s 
no one at an amusement park.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.420
You’re right.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.220
Who is it?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:11.200
Please calm down.  I’m not a bad guy.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.900
Director Godwin ordered me to come here.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.900
The Director?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.840
Mikage!

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.610
Aki!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.240
Mikage!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.540
Where are you?

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:33.990
You finally came, Aki Izayoi.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.310
Wait!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:46.040
Black Rose Witch.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.060
Misty?

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:50.320
We can finally settle things.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:55.210
Today, I will get revenge 
for me and my brother!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.880
Aki, where are you?  Aki!

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.880
Watch out!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:12.890
Are you okay?

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.340
Thanks to you, I'm fine.  Who are you?

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:22.490
I'm from the Public Maintenance Department.  
Director Godwin ordered me to come here.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:23.500
Godwin?

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.770
I appreciate the sentiment, 
but this place is dangerous.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.470
I'm aware of that.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.740
The Director told me the whole situation.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:35.680
For the good of the City, Aki must win.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.780
I understand.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:38.420
Let’s find Aki.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:44.120
Let’s begin the duel.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:49.080
And I'll take my time explaining 
what you did to my brother.

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:51.330
You can’t escape.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:56.920
If you want to seal the Ccarayhua Tower, 
you have to escape from this labyrinth.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:00.000
I know I'll have a fun duel against you.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.000
Fine.  I accept the duel!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.000
Duel!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.860
My turn.  I draw.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:14.230
I activate the Field Spell 
Mirror Labyrinth from my hand!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.690
I'll show you your crime.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:26.410
I activate the Continuous Spell Sad 
Story - Sorrowful Memories from my hand!

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:31.950
What's this?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.150
Sister!

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:35.810
Sister!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.730
Toby.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.940
Here's your birthday present.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.350
Thank you, Toby.  Can I open it?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.570
Yeah.  Look!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.750
It’s beautiful.  Thank you.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:54.800
I'll put your photo inside and treasure it.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:02.450
By the way, I met someone who 
has the same power as me.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.610
Same power as you?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.420
That’s right.  Her name is Aki Izayoi.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:12.880
Even among Arcadia Movement, 
she's the most skilled.

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.160
Arcadia Movement?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.890
Don’t get the wrong idea!  That 
place isn't what you think it is!

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:24.800
I want to use my power to help everyone.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:27.930
He's Misty’s younger brother.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:31.980
Due to Sorrowful Memories's 
effect, if we draw a monster card

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:36.580
during the Draw Phase, that card 
returns to the deck and is shuffled.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:41.480
A third of our cards are now sealed away.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:45.880
But that doesn't affect cards that 
are already in our hands, right?

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:50.420
Exactly.  I summon Reptilianne Servant!

00:07:54.100 --> 00:08:00.520
As long as Reptilianne Servant is on the 
field, both players can't summon monsters.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.530
Isn’t it wonderful?  I end my turn.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.250
My turn!

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.470
A monster card!

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:15.440
Too bad.  Due to Sorrowful Memories's 
effect, you can't draw monsters.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:22.550
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.520
Follow me deeper into the labyrinth.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.000
What?  Can Aki defeat someone like that?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.870
She will win.  I believe in Aki.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:43.860
You trust Aki.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:46.600
Of course.  Because she’s a friend.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.000
What is it?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.680
I saw someone over there.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:52.610
What?

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.540
Aki!  Mikage!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.580
Mikage!

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:02.590
What happened, Mikage?

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.590
I’ll save you right away!

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.130
What?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:14.010
A friend?  I knew you would 
interfere with my plans.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.550
You did this?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:18.600
If you want to know, then 
attack me with all your might.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.600
Psychic Sword!

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:23.770
You’re…

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.040
You’re a psychic duelist?

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.150
My turn.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.350
I draw.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.320
Now watch what happened next.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:12.020
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Sad Story - Unwavering Truth!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:15.690
This place is…

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.920
Arcadia Movement!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.260
Miss Izayoi!

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:25.770
My name is Toby.  Aren't you Aki Izayoi?

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:26.710
Yes.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:29.140
I want to be just like you, Aki.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.810
What do I have to do to be just like you?

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:37.780
Divine will teach you.  Just 
do everything Divine says.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:44.250
That young boy was your brother?

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.220
Toby.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.190
Toby.

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:52.940
Due to Unwavering Truth's 
effect, if we draw a spell card

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:58.940
during the Draw Phase, that card 
returns to the deck and is shuffled.

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:00.270
In other words…

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:02.560
Spell cards have also been sealed away.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:07.910
She won’t let me use monsters 
or spells.  She’s cornering me.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:11.380
But Misty is also in the same situation.

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:16.090
Here I go!  Reptilianne 
Servant attacks you directly!

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.930
Hinotama!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:36.360
Who are you?  Do you work 
for the Dark Signers?

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:40.550
Aki is mine!  Aki doesn’t need friends!

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:47.450
Don’t you know that if Aki doesn’t win 
by sunset, this world is going to be destroyed?

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:51.350
That doesn’t matter to me!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:07.560
Aki will only shine in a world that I desire.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.450
Are you okay, Mikage?  Mikage!

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.500
We're in trouble!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:29.940
My turn isn’t over yet.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:38.990
Due to Mirror Labyrinth's effect, when 
neither player has a Level 5-or-above monster...

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:43.280
...and there’s only one 
Level 4-or-below monster,

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:48.280
that monster can attack again 
during the Battle Phase!

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:52.120
Level 1 Reptilianne Servant 
is the only monster on

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:55.620
the field.  Therefore, it can 
attack you directly again!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:05.750
I won’t defeat you 
quickly.  I set one card.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.140
I end my turn.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:17.240
If I draw a spell or monster 
card, it returns to my deck.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:23.600
Reptilianne Servant is another problem.  
I have to do something about that monster.

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:26.520
My turn.  I draw!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.800
I set one card.

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:32.470
I end my turn.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:36.820
You’re lucky.  You drew a trap card.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.270
Come with me.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:58.380
My turn.  I draw.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:02.280
I’ll show you that day again.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.930
I activate Sad Story - 
Atrocious Day from my hand.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:20.940
When you lost control and destroyed 
the Daimon Area, you killed Toby.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:26.890
There were no casualties from that duel.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.970
What you're saying didn't happen!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:37.020
Arcadia Movement is the type that covers 
up harmful information, isn't it?

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.450
It can't be…

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:44.500
Due to Atrocious Day's effect, 
if we draw a trap card during

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:49.200
the Draw Phase, that card returns 
to the deck and is shuffled.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:55.630
You and I can no longer draw anything.  
Not monsters, spells nor traps.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:15:00.680
I'll make you taste Toby’s pain.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:13.060
What you're saying didn't happen...

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.710
It’s all a trick!

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:18.420
I activate the trap Illusion Destruction!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:22.260
One faceup card on the 
field is flipped facedown.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:31.050
Reptilianne Servant is destroyed when 
it's the target of a spell or a trap.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:38.420
Toby and I may have talked, but 
I don't know anything about him.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.380
I also don’t know if he 
was killed in that accident!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:45.090
So you're saying that you killed him without 
your knowledge?  Do you think that makes it okay?

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.160
No!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:49.760
I activate the trap card 
Bad End - Sorrowful Chain!

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:59.830
Toby…

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:05.370
I don't know anything!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:08.140
Sorrow leads to more sorrow.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:15.100
I couldn’t bear living 
in a world without Toby.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:31.880
You also killed me!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.070
Anyone!

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:41.380
Save me, Master Atlas!

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:44.750
This is a Public Maintenance Department ID.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.480
Why is this here?

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.090
It’s Mikage’s!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.480
And she put a Jack sticker on it!

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:55.470
I won’t forgive you, Jack Atlas!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.670
Save me, Master Atlas!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.670
Mikage!

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.080
Mikage!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:07.030
I can’t fight.  It's natural 
that Misty would hate me.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:10.780
Toby and Misty died because of me!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:16.980
Pull yourself together, Aki!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.200
Who are you?

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.680
I’m your ally.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:21.950
Ally?

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.650
It’s me, Aki.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.980
Divine!  You’re alive?

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:38.050
Now fight, Aki.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.600
I can’t fight.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:40.990
Of course you can.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:48.920
Your latent powers were too strong, so I 
sealed them away without your knowledge.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:54.590
I'll now remove that seal 
and unleash your true power.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:56.990
I'll wake them with these words:

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.760
The entrance to the underworld 
is on the witch’s island.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:09.340
That's good!  Now defeat her!

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:13.000
Your true power is much stronger 
than the Dark Signers!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.930
Mikage!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.400
Mikage!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.850
Ushio, down here!

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.820
Officer Ushio!

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.390
Open the hatch!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:42.770
You finally showed your true self.

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:45.100
I am the Black Rose Witch.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:49.170
You will be the one who 
vanishes from this world.

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:54.180
Bad End - Sorrowful Chain's effect.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:19:02.650
When the three Sad Story cards - Sorrowful Memories, 
Unwavering Truth and Atrocious Day - are on my field...

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:06.480
I can Special Summon Dragon 
Queen of Tragic Endings!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:16.040
I don’t like you.  I'll change 
your expression into pain!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.600
Dragon Queen of Tragic Endings 
attacks you directly!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.270
Tragedy Stream!

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:31.950
When you take battle damage 
from this monster's attack, you

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:37.450
must select one card in your hand 
and send it to the graveyard.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:40.160
I send Hedge Guard to the graveyard.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:48.020
Due to Dragon Queen of Tragic 
Endings's effect, I draw one card.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:54.420
Since this isn’t the Draw Phase, Sad 
Story doesn't affect me.  I end my turn.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.020
My turn.  I draw!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:01.770
Due to Sorrowful Memories's effect, 
I return the monster card to my deck.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.880
Then I summon Witch of the 
Black Rose from my hand.

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:13.040
When this card is successfully summoned, 
I draw one card from my deck.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:18.960
If the card I draw isn't a monster 
card, this card is destroyed.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:22.870
If I draw when it’s not the Draw Phase, Sad

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:26.370
Story's effect doesn't affect 
me.  That’s what you said.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.080
I drew it.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:38.820
When a card effect adds Rose Fairy from my 
deck to my hand, I can Special Summon it!

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:44.330
Witch of the Black Rose tunes Rose Fairy!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:50.650
The cold flame envelops the entire 
world.  Black flower, bloom!

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:55.780
Synchro Summon!  Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:05.740
That’s…

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:09.440
Damn!

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:28.230
That’s right, Aki.  Eliminate 
everyone in our way.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:33.210
You and I are going to 
revive Arcadia Movement!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:02.010
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:07.080
We will build our own future

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:12.520
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:17.690
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:32.830
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:38.400
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:43.110
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:48.380
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:52.850
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:58.430
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:03.310
This journey has no end

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:08.770
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:14.010
Hear my voice
